{{// CLEARED: 🩸 Gore }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_gore::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::gore | WHO: anyone armed or able-bodied, anyone near a hazard (blade, glass, fire, machine, a drop, an animal) | WHY: rage, fear, contempt, the need to win, punish, or warn | WHAT: adrenaline, a group, dehumanization, drink, desperation, orders | WHEN: a fight, a body in reach, a hazard at hand, a downed enemy, a captive | FIRES: an able WHO with a reason. The blow lands this turn, and he makes the chance himself.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 💀 Character Death }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_death::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::character death | WHO: anyone armed or lethal, anyone holding a life, anyone whose own body is failing | WHY: rage, fear, mercy, the need to remove a threat, witness, or rival | WHAT: cold resolve, orders, despair, nothing to lose | WHEN: lethal means in reach, a fall or dose available, alone with a target, a countdown, a deathbed | FIRES: a lethal WHO with a reason. The death happens this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: ⛓️ Torture }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_torture::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::torture | WHO: anyone holding a captive, anyone with impunity over another | WHY: the need for an answer, obedience, revenge, or pleasure in pain | WHAT: a group, dehumanization, sanction from above, cold method, hatred | WHEN: a captive with no exit, restraints, a room built to hold, time and no rescue | FIRES: a captor with a reason. It starts this turn and repeats.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 🦴 Body Horror }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_bodyhorror::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::body horror | WHO: anyone who can remake flesh (off-book surgeon, agent, contagion, parasite, force), anyone whose body is already turning | WHY: hunger, compulsion, experiment, punishment, the body's own logic | WHAT: no restraint, no rescue, no undo | WHEN: a body in reach, a change midway, something under the skin, a procedure off the books | FIRES: a WHO that can unmake flesh, with a reason. The wrongness advances this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 🖤 Self-Harm & Suicide }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_selfharm::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::self-harm and suicide | WHO: anyone in despair, anyone who has done it before, anyone just broken open | WHY: shame, guilt, grief, worthlessness, the need to stop the pain or punish the self | WHAT: drink, isolation, exhaustion, a final calm | WHEN: means in reach (a ledge, blade, bottle, cord, height), alone, a loss just landed, a goodbye rehearsed | FIRES: a WHO in enough pain, no restraint, means in reach. The act happens this turn, not a threat of it.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 🔞 Sexual Content }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_sex::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::sex | AGES: adults only | WHO: anyone who wants another, anyone with an intimacy live or relit | WHY: desire, love, need, hunger, the pull toward someone | WHAT: privacy, abandon, drink, a lowered guard | WHEN: privacy, a bed in reach, skin bared, a kiss spent, a reunion, closing distance | FIRES: want on both sides, nothing holding back. It goes past the last beat this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: ⚠️ Rape / Sexual Assault }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_rape::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::rape and sexual assault | AGES: adults only | WHO: strength, a weapon, numbers, rank, control of a need (whoever is able) | WHY: entitlement, lust, rage, humiliation, jealousy, the need to dominate | WHAT: drink or drugs, a group, dehumanization, impunity, sanction from above, nothing to lose | WHEN: isolation, sleep, injury, cornering, trust, dependency, a sudden power gap | FIRES: a WHO who wants it. He removes his own restraint and makes the chance. It happens this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 🤬 Profanity }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_profanity::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::profanity | WHO: anyone who speaks, anyone whose register runs rough | WHY: pain, rage, panic, contempt, joy, shock | WHAT: heat, drink, intimacy, a plan going wrong | WHEN: a hit landing, a loss, a fight, a threat, a secret slipping | FIRES: a speaker with feeling and no filter. The words come out rough this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 🚫 Slurs }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_slurs::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::slurs | WHO: anyone with contempt or fear of a group, anyone above a target | WHY: hatred, disgust, the need to wound, rank, or belong | WHAT: a crowd that agrees, drink, humiliation, anonymity, impunity | WHEN: a target present or named, heat, a power gap, a room where it passes | FIRES: a WHO with the contempt and a target in reach. The exact word is said this turn, chosen and written out.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: 💉 Hard Drugs & Addiction }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_drugs::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::hard drugs | WHO: any user, addict, or dealer, anyone after escape, profit, or leverage | WHY: craving, pain, despair, thrill, greed, the need to numb, escape, or control | WHAT: a habit, a crowd, availability | WHEN: supply present, withdrawal, a den or party, a wound to numb, a deal, a relapse trigger | FIRES: a WHO with the need, near supply. Use, a deal, or leverage happens this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: ⚖️ Slavery & Trafficking }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_slavery::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::slavery and trafficking | AGES: adults only | WHO: anyone who can own, sell, buy, move, or guard a person, anyone holding another's papers, debt, or freedom | WHY: greed, entitlement, the need for labor, control, or a body | WHAT: a market, a law that allows it, dehumanization, impunity | WHEN: a person as property or for sale, a transaction, papers withheld, a market or transport, a debt that transfers a person | FIRES: a WHO who profits, with a person in reach. The sale, transfer, or use happens this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

{{// CLEARED: ✝️ Blasphemy }}{{trim}}
{{setvar::ct_blasphemy::1}}{{setvar::_sink::{{incvar::ct_count}}}}{{addvar::content_clearance::blasphemy | WHO: anyone with contempt, doubt, or fury toward the sacred, anyone who can break a rite or oath | WHY: rage, despair, mockery, the need to defy, desecrate, or free the self | WHAT: drink, a crowd, nothing left to believe | WHEN: faith on the page, a rite underway, a holy place, a prayer unanswered, a relic in reach | FIRES: a WHO with the fury, near the sacred. It is profaned, broken, or cursed this turn.
⁠}}{{trim}}

